<h1 id="project-nebula--notes">Project <em>Nebula</em> — Notes</h1>
<p>Nebula is a <strong>fast</strong>, <em>small</em> &amp; &quot;friendly&quot; tool.
It handles <code>a &lt; b &amp;&amp; c</code> and <code>code with ` tick</code>.
Line with hard break
next line.</p>
<h2 id="install">Install</h2>
<ol>
<li>Download from <a href="https://example.com/dl?x=1&amp;y=2">https://example.com/dl?x=1&amp;y=2</a></li>
<li>Run <code>make</code>
<ul>
<li>on <em>Linux</em>: use gcc</li>
<li>on macOS: use clang</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li>Profit</li>
<li>five</li>
<li>six</li>
</ol>
<ul>
<li>star item with <a href="http://a.b/c" title="Title here">a link</a></li>
<li>see <a href="https://docs.example.org">the docs</a> or <a href="https://docs.example.org">Docs</a></li>
<li>plus is still a bullet</li>
</ul>
